From: engine <engine@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 10:20:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20JMAP=20R8=20rules=20=E2=80=94=20dontwa?=
 =?UTF-8?q?rn=20lombok.**=20+=20keep=20rs.ltt.jmap=20models?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Java compile fully passed; R8 minify (githubRelease) failed on missing
lombok.NonNull (compile-only, referenced by rs.ltt.jmap Lombok entities) and
would also strip/rename the Gson-reflected entity fields at runtime. Add
-dontwarn lombok.** + -keep rs.ltt.jmap model classes/members.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 app/proguard-rules.pro | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/proguard-rules.pro b/app/proguard-rules.pro
index afc2899847..80c256b30d 100644
--- a/app/proguard-rules.pro
+++ b/app/proguard-rules.pro
@@ -164,4 +164,12 @@
 
 #EvalEx
 -dontwarn lombok.Generated
--keep class com.ezylang.evalex.** {*;}
\ No newline at end of file
+-keep class com.ezylang.evalex.** {*;}
+
+# comms: rs.ltt.jmap (JMAP client) — Lombok-annotated, Gson-serialized entities.
+# R8 fails on the compile-only lombok.NonNull reference and would strip/rename
+# the reflected entity fields, breaking JMAP JSON. Silence lombok + keep the
+# library's model classes/members intact.
+-dontwarn lombok.**
+-keep class rs.ltt.jmap.** { *; }
+-keepclassmembers class rs.ltt.jmap.** { *; }
\ No newline at end of file
-- 
2.44.2

